<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal January-November 1996 ca deficit up yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Portugal January-November 1996 ca deficit up yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's current account deficit rose to 724.7 billion escudos between January and November 1996 from a deficit of 548.6 billion in the same period of 1995, the Bank of Portugal said in its report for December.</p>
</text>
